{"overview":"همه‌ی افسانه‌های شهری فقط افسانه نیستند. بعضی‌ها واقعی‌اند و در حال ظهور هستند. فوشیگی در سراسر ژاپن با کلاه قرمزش می‌گردد و آن‌ها را در دفترچه‌ی جادویی‌اش قفل می‌کند، در حالی که جیمی، سگ چهره‌ی انسانی‌اش، در کنارش است. هر پدیده او را یک قدم به سمت گرفتن هیمتسو، دختری که مسئول ظهور موجودات فراطبیعی است، نزدیک‌تر می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Not all urban legends are myths. Some are real, and they’re coming to life. Fushigi roams Japan in a red hood, sealing them inside his magical notebook, with Jimmy, his human-faced dog, by his side. Each phenomenon brings him one step closer to capturing Himitsu, the girl responsible for manifesting the supernatural beings.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/kUfHYJr89qvmwJSRKo4r4kMK1Mr.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"石橋陽彩","role":"Fushigi Chino (voice)","photo":"/xDfX7mWq67zoymw5V7vEu22pf5r.jpg","en":"Hiiro Ishibashi"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"Himitsu (voice)","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"福山潤","role":"Jimmy (voice)","photo":"/eT9eloyIaIkTvTqMmpcsAleP2hM.jpg","en":"Jun Fukuyama"},{"name":"岡本信彦","role":"Blue Umbrella Man (voice)","photo":"/7s1K2yQVF5iIWILaOfG7QrMZkXA.jpg","en":"Nobuhiko Okamoto"},{"name":"平塚紗依","role":"Momo (voice)","photo":"/87wJrunEuhXIJqu9weXSEpnfr2j.jpg","en":"Sae Hiratsuka"},{"name":"逢坂良太","role":"Raita (voice)","photo":"/d2TGy8Qkxe90tGDr9MCXFGkhbPl.jpg","en":"Ryota Osaka"},{"name":"هانا هیشیکاوا","role":"Sachiko Konno (voice)","photo":"/epCzuP9ZmBMonKK2Z6FOKoq2b7k.jpg","en":"Hana Hishikawa"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/307903/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/307903/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","lo